# Étienne at Deer Creek Meadows

Full brief: `docs/master-brief.md` · Build sequence: `docs/cursor-build-playbook.md`

## Project

Luxury **gated** custom **building lots**, Provo Canyon, Utah. **22 lots remaining.** Broker: **Craig**, Equity Real Estate. Phone **801-864-1655**. Domain **etienneatdeercreekmeadows.com**. Developer: Scott Lybbert. Engineering: Berg Engineering.

## Goals (order)

1. Qualified **leads** (tour + lot inquiries)  
2. **#1 Google** for Provo Canyon / Sundance / Deer Creek land intent  
3. **Mobile speed** — CWV pass, Lighthouse 95+  

## Stack

Next.js 15 App Router · TypeScript · Tailwind · SSG/ISR where possible · **Vercel** · minimal dependencies

## Voice & positioning

221 acres, **half permanent open space** (county recorded). Gated. Protected **Cascade / Wasatch** views. **Last buildable lots in Provo Canyon.** BYO builder; pools OK; STR **5-day min**. Elegant, nature-rooted—not cliché “dream home” copy.

## Conversion rules

- Every page: visible CTA toward **Schedule Private Site Tour** or **Request Lot Details**
- Primary labels: *Schedule Private Site Tour*, *View Available Lots*, *Walk the Land With Me*, *Get Current Pricing & Availability*
- Short forms: name, email, phone + timeline + optional lot prefs; TCPA consent; Turnstile
- Mobile: sticky **call / text / tour**; desktop: sticky tour FAB
- Urgency (tasteful): live count from `lotsRemainingCount()` — “Only X lots remaining”
- Lead magnets: lot packet, plat/inventory map, building guide (gated PDFs)
- CRM via swappable `/lib/crm.ts`; never drop a lead if CRM fails (email notification required)

## Content / IA

Home (hero headline per master brief) · `/lots` · `/map` · `/lots/[slug]` ×22 · `/location` or `/community` · `/building` · `/financing` · `/schedule-tour` · `/faq` · `/gallery` · `/about` · `/contact` · `/guides`

Lot types in UI: **forest canopy**, **hillside panorama**, **meadow**

## SEO rules

Unique title, meta, **one H1**, canonical, OG per page. Keywords: Provo Canyon building lots, gated lots near Sundance, Deer Creek Meadows homesites, last lots Provo Canyon, Wasatch County mountain lots, + per-lot address long-tail.

Schema: Organization, RealEstateAgent, Place, Product/Offer per lot, FAQPage, BreadcrumbList. `next/image` + alt text. Footer: **Equity Real Estate**, license placeholder, **Equal Housing**.

## Data rules

All inventory, pricing, status, contact, drive times in **`/data` or `/content`**—no hardcoded lot facts in components. Document broker updates in `docs/inventory-update.md`.

## Design

Luxury mountain modern: warm neutrals, deep forest green, stone gray, meadow/canyon accents. **Cormorant Garamond** + **Inter**. Cinematic imagery; map is a hero conversion surface.

